  "description": "Non material amendment to planning reference PA25/2538 to  amend the design so that the extension is built up to the boundary line between 61 and 63, rather than over it. This results in a minor reduction in the overall footprint of the extension.\r\nIn addition, we have clarified the design of the glass element of the extension roof. During discussions with the planning officer, we\r\nwere advised that the glazed roof must not project above the parapet wall when viewed from the rear. Our revised plans reflect this\r\nrequirement. The cross-section has been updated to accurately show the slight roof slope necessary for drainage; this slope remains\r\nwholly below the height of the parapet."
